Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:29.16,OTHERS,,0,0,0,,{\a1\fad(459,0)\fn@方正准圆_GBK\frz-90\fs80\c&H000201&\fsp7\bord3\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(450,120)\b1}不知为何有\N{\alphaff\t(375,1300,\alpha00)\c&HF1F1F1&\3c}创可贴{\c&H000201&\3c&HFFFFFF&}和{\c&HD69E19&\3c\alpha00}消毒水
